  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "528b350b-503e-edf9-0b97-e721533db8b4",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "289ed41c-f9a4-0df4-f72f-1e31746602d5",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Carole is the Digital Editor at Standard Group, Kenya, was among 11 other board members who were elected during the WAN-IFRA annual general meeting held on 17 June 2022. According to a statement published on its website, \"the changes in WAN-IFRA's Board of Directors signal it's ongoing commitment to deliver on its strategic plan for diversity and inclusion, initiated in 2017 and ensure that WAN-IFRA has the additional skillsets and experience to support future developments in different parts of the world.\"",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Speaking on the appointments, Vincent Peyregne, WAN-IFRA's CEO noted the advances to the diversity and expertise of the board and growth in number of women in senior leadership positions in the media. He hoped that this and future elections will pave the way towards achieving parity as an industry.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "WAN-IFRA's other board members are:",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet_list",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "list_item",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Lina Attalah, Co-founder and Director, Mada Masr Media, Egypt",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "list_item",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Marijana Bojanic, CEO, Vijesti, Montenegro",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "list_item",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Juan Pablo Bojanini, President, El Heraldo de Barranquilla, Colombia",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "list_item",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Alia Ibrahim, Co-founder and CEO, Daraj Media, Lebanon",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "list_item",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Mohit Jain, Executive Director, Bennett, Coleman & Co, India",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "list_item",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Barbara Kaija, Editor in Chief, New Vision, Uganda",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "list_item",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Patty Michalski, Sr VP Content Strategy and Innovation, Hearst, USA",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "list_item",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Agnes Kalekye Nguna, COO, Radio Africa Group Limited, Kenya",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "list_item",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Caroline Southey, Founding Editor, The Conversation Africa, South Africa",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "list_item",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Lay Lim Teo, CEO, SPH Media Ltd, Singapore",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Congratulations Carole!",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
